[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the expansion joint to the EGr electrical\nvalve.</p><p>2. Undo the botls and nut securing the EGR electrical valve to the\nintake manifold.</p><p>3. Disconnect the EGR valve actuator electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>EGR solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024367\">L30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Remove the EGR electrical valve from the engine bay.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002374.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the EGR electrical valve to its seat\non the intake manifold.</p><p>Tighten the retaining nut and bolts to\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the EGR valve actuator electrical\nconnection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>EGR solenoid</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024367\">L30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the bolts securing the expansion\njoint to the EGR electrical valve to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]